    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc01_0280_student1_02",
      "hash64": "088E166CA2287891",
      "text": "丹瑜託我傳話，\\n她說她在家等[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳，\\r\\n要[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳趕快過去。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
