      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc01_0280_student1_03",
      "hash64": "088E156CA22876DE",
      "text": "和她搭檔的我被晾在一旁，\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳卻被邀請到家裡……\\r\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳們是什麼關係？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
