    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc01_0280_student2_01",
      "hash64": "0752CB677B1ADDCF",
      "text": "昨天管理員\\n給我看了很酷的面具。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc01_0280_student3_01",
      "hash64": "31D0DF5C31B2501A",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳已經找完所有的看板了！？\\n好快喔，真是太厲害了！\\c\\n和我同一組的姐姐擔心我的身體，\\n所以她配合我放慢腳步找。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
